  <p class="crumbs"><a href="../index.html">课目表</a><span class="sep">/</span>L2 节点字典<span class="sep">/</span>L2-02 条件与编码</p>

  <header class="hero">
    <span class="kicker">L2 节点字典 · 第二册</span>
    <h1>条件与编码：<br>把“图”和“话”变成模型听得懂的指令</h1>
    <p class="lede">采样器只认一种输入：条件（CONDITIONING）。文本、参考图、控制图、风格向量，最后都要被翻译成它。这一册按“条件从哪来”来查。</p>
  </header>

  <h2 id="flow"><span class="no">01 / 一张图看懂</span>条件的两条来路</h2>
  <figure class="fig">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 460 220" role="img" aria-label="文本经翻译与 CLIP 编码成为条件，参考图经控制或风格适配成为附加条件，汇入采样">
      <defs>
        <marker id="ar" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6" refY="3.5" orient="auto">
          <path d="M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7 Z" fill="#5d6779"/>
        </marker>
      </defs>
      <!-- 上排 -->
      <rect x="8" y="24" width="92" height="48" rx="9" fill="#fff" stroke="#cbc6ba"/>
      <text x="54" y="42" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" class="svg-title">提示词</text>
      <text x="54" y="59" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" class="svg-sub">中文 / 英文</text>

      <line x1="104" y1="48" x2="126" y2="48" stroke="#5d6779" stroke-width="1.4" marker-end="url(#ar)"/>

      <rect x="130" y="24" width="92" height="48" rx="9" fill="#fff" stroke="#cbc6ba"/>
      <text x="176" y="42" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" class="svg-title">翻译 / 识别</text>
      <text x="176" y="59" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" class="svg-sub">可选</text>

      <line x1="226" y1="48" x2="248" y2="48" stroke="#5d6779" stroke-width="1.4" marker-end="url(#ar)"/>

      <rect x="252" y="24" width="92" height="48" rx="9" fill="#eef0ff" stroke="#4051d6"/>
      <text x="298" y="42" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" class="svg-title">CLIP 编码</text>
      <text x="298" y="59" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" class="svg-sub">变成条件</text>

      <line x1="348" y1="48" x2="370" y2="48" stroke="#5d6779" stroke-width="1.4" marker-end="url(#ar)"/>

      <rect x="374" y="24" width="80" height="48" rx="9" fill="#eef0ff" stroke="#4051d6"/>
      <text x="414" y="48" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" class="svg-title">条件</text>

      <!-- 下排 -->
      <rect x="8" y="130" width="92" height="48" rx="9" fill="#fff" stroke="#cbc6ba"/>
